  "helpFaqHowWorksQ": "How does Qmatch work?",
  "helpFaqHowWorksA": "Qmatch suggests people based on how you think (IQ), feel (EQ), and connect (Frequency), plus your profile. It is for discovering compatible connections—not a guarantee that any relationship will work out.",
  "helpFaqRankingQ": "How are matches ranked?",
  "helpFaqRankingA": "Discover suggestions use compatibility signals (including Frequency patterns, archetype, interests, and supporting IQ/EQ bands). Rankings are app suggestions, not absolute truth.",
  "helpFaqFrequencyQ": "What does Frequency mean?",
  "helpFaqFrequencyA": "Frequency describes how someone builds connection and communication rhythm—things like depth, social energy, and pace. It is an in-app style signal, not a clinical label.",
  "helpFaqScoresQ": "Are IQ and EQ real medical or official tests?",
  "helpFaqScoresA": "No. Qmatch IQ, EQ, and Frequency scores are app-specific compatibility signals for matching. They are not medical, clinical, or official intelligence certifications.",
  "helpFaqPhotosQ": "Are photos visible on Qmatch?",
  "helpFaqPhotosA": "Yes. Photos and profile details you add can appear to others when you are discoverable. Only share what you are comfortable showing.",
  "helpFaqBlockQ": "How do I block someone?",
  "helpFaqBlockA": "Open a chat → menu → Block. Blocked people appear under Settings → Blocked users. Blocking helps stop further contact in the app.",
  "helpFaqReportQ": "How do I report someone?",
  "helpFaqReportA": "Open a chat → menu → Report and choose a reason. Reports are saved for review so we can help keep the community safer.",
  "helpFaqSafetyQ": "Any tips for meeting offline?",
  "helpFaqSafetyA": "Meet in a public place, tell a friend where you are, arrange your own transport, and never send money or sensitive documents to someone you only know through the app.",
  "helpFaqAgeQ": "What is the minimum age?",
  "helpFaqAgeA": "Qmatch is for adults. Profiles use an age of at least 18.",
  "helpFaqDeleteAccountQ": "How do I delete my account?",
  "helpFaqDeleteAccountA": "Go to Settings → Delete account, read the notices, confirm both checkboxes, type DELETE, and submit. We process requests within 30 days. You can also email support@qmatch.site.",
  "helpFaqDataQ": "What data does Qmatch use?",
  "helpFaqDataA": "Depending on what you use: sign-in details, profile and photos, assessment answers and results, matches/messages, and safety actions like reports and blocks. See the Privacy Policy for more detail.",
